<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/ConfidentialityLevelType/amber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Limited distribution - organization and clients. The dataset shall be shared only with specific organizations and their clients on a need-to-know basis."@en .
